title: 'Atlas the Cartographer — Agent #67 shipped (v6.2.0)'
summary: 'Designed and implemented Atlas (archetype: cartographer, tier-1/opus), Agent #67 in the Paradigm roster. Atlas fires during orchestration after Builder to detect architectural changes and keep .paradigm/arch.yaml current. Ships with two MCP tools (paradigm_arch_status, paradigm_arch_diagram), a paradigm arch CLI, arch-loader utility, feature-tier registration, ContextBrief archMap field, and three PARA 701 lessons with quizzes + 5 PLSAT slots.'
